  * @}
  */


/** @addtogroup IWDG_Exported_Functions_Group2
  *  @brief   IO operation functions
  *
@verbatim
 ===============================================================================
                      ##### IO operation functions #####
 ===============================================================================
 [..]  This section provides functions allowing to:
