     (+) HAL_USARTEx_ConfigNSS API configures the Slave Select input pin (NSS)
     (+) HAL_USARTEx_EnableFifoMode() API enables the FIFO mode
     (+) HAL_USARTEx_DisableFifoMode() API disables the FIFO mode
