             (++) |4WS(5 CPU cycles)|  168 < HCLK <= 210| 136 < HCLK <= 170| 120 < HCLK <= 150| 80 < HCLK <= 100  |
             (++) |-----------------|-------------------|------------------|------------------|-------------------|
             (++) |5WS(6 CPU cycles)|  210 < HCLK <= 250| 170 < HCLK <= 200|        NA        |         NA        |
